<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Remove Poison</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 13), Druid (guild level 28)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast remove poison &lt;target&gt;
cast remove poison &lt;food or drink&gt;
</pre>
<p>Cast on a poisoned person or creature, it drives the poison out. Your spell 
needs at least a quarter of the poison's power, so even a weak one cures most 
poisons. Cast on food or a drink, in the room, in your inventory or held, it 
makes it safe to eat or drink.
</p><p>It doesn't clean a poisoned weapon. You must be standing. It is also found on 
potions, wands, scrolls and staffs. To find out what is poisoned, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Detect Poison</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Poison</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Disease</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>